Junior's Suite
Upper-level Carriage House retreat
Located on the upper level of our restored Carriage House, Junior's Suite is a bright, airy retreat named after the Hubbs family patriarch. Ideal for families or a group of friends, the suite features two king bedrooms, one full bathroom, and a large, comfortable living room with elevated views of the surrounding neighborhood. The fully equipped kitchen makes it easy to enjoy home-cooked meals, and everything Hammondsport has to offer — wineries, restaurants, the lakefront — is just a short stroll away.
Features
Enjoy a unique and relaxing stay with all the comforts of home, plus a few special touches to make your visit even more memorable:
Two king bedrooms with elevated views
Large, comfortable living room
Fully equipped kitchen
Convenient location just steps from Keuka Lake and the Village Square
